!-----------------------------------------------------------------------
!     Test for heat and compositional source terms
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------
!
This test is to obtain static solution of temperature and composition with heat and compositional source terms in Calypso.
The sources are defined by interpolation from reference field data file.

This example consists of the following files and directories
README:              This file
Makefile:            Makefile for the test
control_MHD:         Control file for simulation and initial field generation
control_resolution:  Control file for spatial resolution
radial_field.dat:    Reference field data file

reference:          Directory for the reference data
rst_1:              Directory for restart files

The following files are generated:
sph_initial_field:        Initial data generation program
picked_mode_l0_m0c.dat:   Spherical harmonics coefficients for Y_{0}^{0} (Sphere average) component
radial_point.dat:         Grid points data
sph_ave_volume_s.dat:     Volume average data
time_total.dat:           Elapsed time data

This example only run with 1 MPI process. The Makefile performs the following procedures by
'make test' command:

1. Construct initial field field by 
	% mpirun -np 1 sph_initial_field
2. Evaluate static solution
	% mpirun -np 1 [CALYPSO_DIR]/bin/sph_mhd
3. Compare with the reference data
	% [CALYPSO_DIR]/bin/tests/sph_picked_mode_check referenceds/picked_mode_l0_m0c.dat picked_mode_l0_m0c.dat

